&lt;p&gt;QUETTA: Four labourers working on an under-construction road were killed by unidentified armed men near the Saranan area of Balochistan’s Pishin district on Tuesday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Officials said the incident took place in the Sulemanzai area along the Quetta-Chaman Highway.&lt;/p&gt;
